# microgpt benchmarks game

community inference benchmarks for karpathy's microgpt.
a minimal gpt trained on a names dataset: https://karpathy.github.io/2026/02/12/microgpt/

the exojit version owns the entire stack — from the python scheduling DSL
down to the assembly instructions. no numpy, no torch, no C compiler.
see microgpt/ for all implementations.


